# .github/workflows/pdf-preview.yml fills public/ with the PDFs a pull request
# affects, a copy of site/style.css and a generated index, then hands the
# directory to wrangler. None of that belongs in the repository.
#
# index.html is the exception: the committed placeholder is what the Worker's
# production URL serves. A preview run overwrites it in the runner's working
# tree, which is harmless because nothing commits from that workflow.
public/*
!public/index.html

# Local wrangler state, written by `wrangler deploy` and friends. Holds the
# resolved Cloudflare account id, which has no business in a public repository.
.wrangler/
